WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.036
Your Record.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.353
It keeps three things apart.

3
00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:07.950
What you hold, which isn’t credit.

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.749
What you contributed, counted from the work itself.

5
00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:14.216
And what you logged yourself.

6
00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:19.179
One document counts once, however many entries it took.

7
00:00:19.729 --> 00:00:23.851
From any case you worked, prepare a private draft,

8
00:00:23.851 --> 00:00:26.712
built only from your own facts.

9
00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:30.993
Keep it, and it lands in your record,

10
00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:34.244
with a link back to the case.
